%!PS
% Two paragraphs of Latin-1 text with sentence punctuation, for the text
% layer: lines, words, sentences, accents (caf\351 = cafe with acute).
/Helvetica findfont dup length dict copy
  dup /Encoding ISOLatin1Encoding put
  /HelveticaLatin1 exch definefont pop
/HelveticaLatin1 findfont 14 scalefont setfont
72 720 moveto (The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. It was) show
72 700 moveto (a bright cold day in April, and the clocks were) show
72 680 moveto (striking thirteen! Did anyone notice? Nobody did.) show
72 640 moveto (Second paragraph starts here. A caf\351 au lait costs) show
72 620 moveto (3.50 euros; the na\357ve waiter smiled.) show
showpage
